{"type":"message","id":"2b4beffe","parentId":"b4895d38","timestamp":"2026-02-28T08:41:49.104Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Mgb0zDIHTUBivQZ7baXqIddH|fc_022820e6e342404f0169a2aa15cc148191aae69652d5992132","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"C:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\date-time.md:50: [WhatsApp +1555 2026-01-18 00:19 PST] hello\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\date-time.md:56: [WhatsApp +1555 2026-01-18 00:19 CST] hello\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\date-time.md:62: [WhatsApp +1555 +30s 2026-01-18T05:19Z] follow-up\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\date-time.md:120: - Telegram/WhatsApp: provider-specific numeric/ISO timestamps\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:4:   \"description\": \"Self-hosted gateway that connects WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, iMessage, and more to AI coding agents. Run a single Gateway process on your own machine and message your AI assistant from anywhere.\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:183:       \"source\": \"/providers/whatsapp\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:184:       \"destination\": \"/channels/whatsapp\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:715:       \"source\": \"/whatsapp\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:716:       \"destination\": \"/channels/whatsapp\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:892:                   \"channels/whatsapp\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:1433:                   \"zh-CN/channels/whatsapp\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:28:   <strong>Any OS gateway for AI agents across WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, iMessage, and more.</strong><br />\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:46: OpenClaw is a **self-hosted gateway** that connects your favorite chat apps �� WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, iMessage, and more �� to AI coding agents like Pi. You run a single Gateway process on your own machine (or a server), and it becomes the bridge between your messaging apps and an always-available AI assistant.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:53: - **Multi-channel**: one Gateway serves WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, and more simultaneously\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:77:     WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, and iMessage with a single Gateway process.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:109:   <Step title=\"Pair WhatsApp and start the Gateway\">\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:127:   <img src=\"whatsapp-openclaw.jpg\" alt=\"OpenClaw\" width=\"420\" />\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:135: - If you want to lock it down, start with `channels.whatsapp.allowFrom` and (for groups) mention rules.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:142:     whatsapp: {\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:164:     Channel-specific setup for WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, and more.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:76: To filter channel activity (WhatsApp/Telegram/etc), use:\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:79: openclaw channels logs --channel whatsapp\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:93: - Subsystem prefixes (e.g. `gateway/channels/whatsapp`)\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi.md:131: ��   ������ whatsapp-actions.ts\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi.md:146:   sessionKey: \"main:whatsapp:+1234567890\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi.md:246: 4. **Channel Tools**: Discord/Telegram/Slack/WhatsApp-specific action tools\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:6: {\"cache_key\":\"01814fd9d09399c075081056c6fa2befa388c67ba4f8745122804fd044fd82d6\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:d1564fd156e28160\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"d1564fd156e28160c83922ad7a18428ce2c966e790f477e740d1d9f6cadd51e9\",\"text\":\"WhatsApp (QR login)\",\"translated\":\"WhatsApp����ά���¼��\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:08Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:7: {\"cache_key\":\"01b87576d7ade6b91ca28935f65c167c2f4fb5d1b6bfd1189fd416b229500af4\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:7421b911bc203f6f\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"7421b911bc203f6fe3c677d752379f23dc314719d39d18179406da675f58d039\",\"text\":\"Scan via WhatsApp �� Settings �� Linked Devices.\",\"translated\":\"ͨ�� WhatsApp �� ���� �� �ѹ����豸 ����ɨ�衣\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:10Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:17: {\"cache_key\":\"045fb6f3989827561e347dfa56a164069bf8b7afaa50d2d02c20ad264495d351\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:e9f63c8876aec738\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"e9f63c8876aec7381ffb5a68efb39f50525f9fc4e732857488561516d47f5654\",\"text\":\" �� Uses Baileys for WhatsApp 