C:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:164:     Channel-specific setup for WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, and more.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:76: To filter channel activity (WhatsApp/Telegram/etc), use:\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:79: openclaw channels logs --channel whatsapp\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:93: - Subsystem prefixes (e.g. `gateway/channels/whatsapp`)\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi.md:131: ��   ������ whatsapp-actions.ts\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi.md:146:   sessionKey: \"main:whatsapp:+1234567890\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi.md:246: 4. **Channel Tools**: Discord/Telegram/Slack/WhatsApp-specific action tools\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:6: {\"cache_key\":\"01814fd9d09399c075081056c6fa2befa388c67ba4f8745122804fd044fd82d6\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:d1564fd156e28160\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"d1564fd156e28160c83922ad7a18428ce2c966e790f477e740d1d9f6cadd51e9\",\"text\":\"WhatsApp (QR login)\",\"translated\":\"WhatsApp����ά���¼��\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:37:08Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:7: {\"cache_key\":\"01b87576d7ade6b91ca28935f65c167c2f4fb5d1b6bfd1189fd416b229500af4\",\"segment_id\":\"start/getting-started.md:7421b911bc203f6f\",\"source_path\":\"start/getting-started.md\",\"text_hash\":\"7421b911bc203f6fe3c677d752379f23dc314719d39d18179406da675f58d039\",\"text\":\"Scan via WhatsApp �� Settings �� Linked Devices.\",\"translated\":\"ͨ�� 