                 \"cli/qr\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:1433:                   \"zh-CN/channels/whatsapp\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:1532:                   \"zh-CN/tools/browser-login\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:28:   <strong>Any OS gateway for AI agents across WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, iMessage, and more.</strong><br />\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:46: OpenClaw is a **self-hosted gateway** that connects your favorite chat apps �� WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, iMessage, and more �� to AI coding agents like Pi. You run a single Gateway process on your own machine (or a server), and it becomes the bridge between your messaging apps and an always-available AI assistant.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:53: - **Multi-channel**: one Gateway serves WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, and more simultaneously\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:77:     WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, and iMessage with a single Gateway process.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:109:   <Step title=\"Pair WhatsApp and start the Gateway\">\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:111:     openclaw channels login\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:127:   <img src=\"whatsapp-openclaw.jpg\" alt=\"OpenClaw\" width=\"420\" />\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:135: - If you want to lock it down, start with `channels.whatsapp.allowFrom` and (for groups) mention rules.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:142:     whatsapp: {\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:164:     Channel-specific setup for WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, and more.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:76: To filter channel activity (WhatsApp/Telegram/etc), use:\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:79: openclaw channels logs --channel whatsapp\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:93: - Subsystem prefixes (e.g. `gateway/channels/whatsapp`)\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi.md:131: ��   ������ whatsapp-actions.ts\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi.md:146:   sessionKey: \"main:whatsapp:+1234567890\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi.md:246: 4. **Channel Tools**: Discord/Telegram/Slack/WhatsApp-specific action tools\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\whatsapp-openclaw-ai-zh.jpg:33: ? ??x?c???N[R&=?\t???Q??S?I!X?\"???=9#?H??????^?qv.???��?x2??(?????uq??t?{%?*?l?=J??\t?????Y+??}}??(??/u;b)QR:\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\whatsapp-openclaw-ai-zh.jpg:142: ?h????7ZK?A??t_??=??)S?`??3e?>??<??????c=$?E???6?F\\?Ii ?jI???##??'??g?3?c?!��S-?\"H??\t.?>_????e???U??k$u??a?@?q1????3?C?4?F???Qr$???#?????|??c?]=f\t:??w??q e??3????4`??w?JP?;??^?^??z??;?P??P?cJ1?\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\whatsapp-openclaw-ai-zh.jpg:161: ?DA~??i_??S@??^?U6<Y?Zq?v?oFrumD?SU?M_??0????'J??-?k??=????t?c?????????*x4??��T?)\tm??k{4?il?-5w#???m@??u????5?Z+k?O?_??jGU2??v2dU?r?O3?j?1???t?$?1S*?????^q??ze????a???C*kb?*uK???;????1?RY??????qX??~}?+,j?Z??q?Y?R?q????4z??????zTl>?????/???\t??Fj[?X?Cg?^?:[?i??Dn?1?[???Dz??????[AD?,qk???????5ph??? ?G?E??\t ?I?O?g???QrW??\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\whatsapp-openclaw-ai-zh.jpg:215: I??]??FaUY??Qr?VD?o??W?k&?????