wU38mGiop2aUVvP0Pa0gvhuJY83d2-5ef_EUHQsWxAwuBgSSk-lB5CIawEU5vjE6MN7xIRdET9a6xTMcRfUUTOyn8H9t-ai1vF9AjJD0w==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying pairing code availability**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]这个我得实话说：**我这边现在拿不到“手机号关联码”**。  \nOpenClaw 当前这条登录流程主要给的是 **QR**，没有单独的“发配对码”参数。\n\n所以你这边最稳还是扫码。  \n如果你坚持手机号关联，可以试下官方 WhatsApp Web/桌面端那套“输入配对码”流程，但 OpenClaw CLI 目前不保证会输出该码。\n\n要不我现在就带你做“二维码可扫优化”（终端字体/缩放/亮度）？一般 1-2 次就能扫上。","textSignature":"msg_022820e6e342404f0169a2b54881a08191ab5ea05afba0cf6e"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":278,"output":285,"cacheRead":55936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56499,"cost":{"input":0.0004865,"output":0.00399,"cacheRead":0.0097888,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0142653}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772270969647}}
