{"type":"message","id":"cfe18074","parentId":"19eaa8eb","timestamp":"2026-02-28T09:29:49.290Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Providing concise login steps**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_022820e6e342404f0169a2b55207448191a0f388b0fbacaeb4\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABporVTBFayV_HHNvCfEibmIPcUYmz2bNiLgD5dIJ9b0yPjiyvnV5xJilHOXbbnae-GpLoKmn6dn50MzqAB0rnpnoJ46yO7PNflkVDfkGZAn3mGWDe6HUZSdnesil-o47EzXEorqT0kKVmLR8M1Uj9M0NIRt2mnIbuBk4iBz8GgU0tVng-d5VfLuN_Crb8ahbwW5MvjSuIS7aHgk5_Lx8HKlGcQ9mcqoKNMAMzdaE5uHInjb8KsTvf-yNI91GpWRe_jpOAWhSBsXuRoRp1oTtEmSmZZF18oDqJB9_4vd-7OUrZX-HwPLcj5nDRi3wBS_XcK_n9OWblwhZ7ZWwVibaENlvsdCn46ruOa7xVS0r0XNTPBUP5xca7319-V4vxzbGhjfca_Wpqy6bw47Hw2lNmTI3df2tx-VYpazhCaTKN7zJq2PqxdTroyKqCPEd4VP1jsnpEt6cqwxMwXBCCeGTISiy4gPJSGJs04cD9__tuPVEM98dcvtbHMuedKCSeL0rcTRtx_viOo0vO4Jo9RYLl2N6pBlTlyJ4kUvipqqGXs8rh5JCtO6ouSVurVJjvZl6OPNDB_AuiKTMyX8BFoATNDWJENXOvrnKynO4FurOizTGyHSAGiaYS4MHRRaT5_VMPIMmmFdCEBZwoul4stI0n3tJLXuDY1kxtmykgCmegmZ_bQ_zeDKs1Ts5EXineexZWinH54AhoDw61gdr-dateWuloOp2_vX3xv5Yjr2L7WUPWHZnbaj0hieYFIRI-5USfvvOseZrsM8EWJ38Ui0YdXmlumEsNw-BLzjxpQklghSM6cwi27XZfQ4vURsaJyvRSJ7Ol6xfushCvqHI_ylL8tBzcfhdzmVGW8cDF-2a95LB8pUHXj4VaVO6nO_iaiGCpa-kH5kG4htXnbYHjP4HWPouriKcMx61fcbd32hBIO4Gpt5fDN_7dSrD19ZfbpX8oMUYjU-E8xXRBONfRBBm-FmtCyHxnGVkfqsXOwcIHgtMgof2g1CkbE0wXBvqE2Z7M-fKGWXSV-BhYA722CVsyJbwUbFRAtDxbGN7dT2WNA3QzcTSY=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Providing concise login steps**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]好，来，按这个“必扫上”流程走：\n\n### A. 先把当前登录进程停掉\n在跑二维码的那个终端里按：  \n**`Ctrl + C`**\n\n---\n\n### B. 换一个更清晰的终端显示\n用 **Windows Terminal**（不要用太老的 cmd 窗口）：\n\n- 字体：`Consolas` 或 `Cascadia Mono`\n- 字号：`14`（不够清再到 16）\n- 窗口：最大化\n- 缩放：100%\n- 屏幕亮度：拉满\n\n---\n\n### C. 重新出二维码（指定你现在的账号）\n```bash\nnpx openclaw channels login --channel whatsapp --account custom-1\n```\n\n---\n\n### D. 手机扫码技巧（关键）\n手机里：**WhatsApp → 设置 → 已关联设备 → 关联设备**\n\n扫码时注意：\n\n- 手机离屏幕 **20~30cm**\n- 别贴太近，先远后近对焦\n- 屏幕不要有反光\n- 如果还是不认，轻微倾斜手机角度\n\n---\n\n### E. 如果还不行（90%是这个）\n先在手机 WhatsApp 的“已关联设备”里删掉 1~2 个旧设备，再扫。\n\n---\n\n你现在先做到 **C 步**，如果还不行，我再给你“最后一招”（把二维码改成浏览器页面显示再扫，清晰度更高）。","textSignature":"msg_022820e6e342404f0169a2b55300448191a55833d0b5cd70a4"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":404,"output":375,"cacheRead":55936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56715,"cost":{"input":0.000707,"output":0.00525,"cacheRead":0.0097888,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0157458}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772270982445}}
