{"type":"message","id":"f025cc3d","parentId":"4bc7ff8f","timestamp":"2026-02-28T10:04:24.754Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_OMEglW2YxjFc1mWAakx7FzdH|fc_022820e6e342404f0169a2bda6b8588191a20fbd1fa79edaea","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"C:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:99:       \"source\": \"/openrouter\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:100:       \"destination\": \"/providers/openrouter\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:515:       \"source\": \"/multi-agent\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:516:       \"destination\": \"/concepts/multi-agent\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:555:       \"source\": \"/provider-routing\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:556:       \"destination\": \"/channels/channel-routing\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:559:       \"source\": \"/concepts/provider-routing\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:560:       \"destination\": \"/channels/channel-routing\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:922:                   \"channels/channel-routing\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:960:                 \"group\": \"Multi-agent\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:961:                 \"pages\": [\"concepts/multi-agent\", \"concepts/presence\"]\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:1009:                   \"tools/multi-agent-sandbox-tools\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:1074:                   \"providers/openrouter\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:1456:                   \"zh-CN/channels/channel-routing\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:1495:                 \"pages\": [\"zh-CN/concepts/multi-agent\", \"zh-CN/concepts/presence\"]\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:1542:                   \"zh-CN/tools/multi-agent-sandbox-tools\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\docs.json:1607:                   \"zh-CN/providers/openrouter\",\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:54: - **Agent-native**: built for coding agents with tool use, sessions, memory, and multi-agent routing\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:71: The Gateway is the single source of truth for sessions, routing, and channel connections.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:82:   <Card title=\"Multi-agent routing\" icon=\"route\">\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:83:     Isolated sessions per agent, workspace, or sender.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:134: - If you **do nothing**, OpenClaw uses the bundled Pi binary in RPC mode with per-sender sessions.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:135: - If you want to lock it down, start with `channels.whatsapp.allowFrom` and (for groups) mention rules.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:143:       allowFrom: [\"+15555550123\"],\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:178:     Complete channel, routing, and media capabilities.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\index.md:180:   <Card title=\"Multi-agent routing\" href=\"/concepts/multi-agent\" icon=\"route\">\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\perplexity.md:5:   - You need PERPLEXITY_API_KEY or OpenRouter setup\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\perplexity.md:12: through Perplexity��s direct API or via OpenRouter.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\perplexity.md:21: ### OpenRouter (alternative)\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\perplexity.md:23: - Base URL: [https://openrouter.ai/api/v1](https://openrouter.ai/api/v1)\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\perplexity.md:24: - Environment variable: `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\perplexity.md:64: If both `PERPLEXITY_API_KEY` and `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` are set, set\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\perplexity.md:71: - `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` or `sk-or-...` �� OpenRouter (`https://openrouter.ai/api/v1`)\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\perplexity.md:72: - Unknown key formats �� OpenRouter (safe fallback)\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi-dev.md:70: - `agents/<agentId>/sessions/` for agent session history\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi-dev.md:71: - `agents/<agentId>/sessions.json` for the session index\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi-dev.md:75: If you only want to reset sessions, delete `agents/<agentId>/sessions/` and `agents/<agentId>/sessions.json` for that agent. Keep `credentials/` if you do not want to reauthenticate.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi.md:527: | Session storage | `~/.pi/agent/sessions/` | `~/.openclaw/agents/<agentId>/sessions/` (or `$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/agents/<agentId>/sessions/`) |\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\prose.md:18: - Multi-agent research + synthesis with explicit parallelism.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\prose.md:38: OpenProse registers `/prose` as a user-invocable skill command. It routes to the OpenProse VM instructions and uses OpenClaw tools under the hood.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tts.md:378: - Commands require an authorized sender (allowlist/owner rules still apply).\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:173: {\"cache_key\":\"2641fa57e655e2907092885b0b24665c212df5b58bb36fa826f14180e4ec67f3\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:99260acc29f71e4b\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"99260acc29f71e4baeb36805a1fdbd2c17254b57c8e5a9cba29ee56518832397\",\"text\":\" �� Route provider accounts/peers to isolated agents (workspace + per-agent sessions)\",\"translated\":\" �� ���ṩ���˻�/�Եȷ�·�ɵ�����������壨������ + ÿ������Ự��\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:30:12Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:208: {\"cache_key\":\"2d0888805bfed46ef5b60cd62356c0e806d41c0b9121d293e637f9c246793517\",\"segment_id\":\"start/wizard.md:f5f5d467d48ef0f0\",\"source_path\":\"start/wizard.md\",\"text_hash\":\"f5f5d467d48ef0f0285b3b241da9c210af806de0b975ef0d1c8caa8e43f02aca\",\"text\":\" to route inbound messages (the wizard can do this).\",\"translated\":\" ��·����վ��Ϣ���򵼿���ִ�д˲�������\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:47:03Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:454: {\"cache_key\":\"5e58639dd12e22ac1e6e022b66e5c0edfaf2e17279bd95