{"type":"message","id":"05ba5b10","parentId":"e3004aaf","timestamp":"2026-02-28T10:04:43.232Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_tzoRLbiBHOSgL9dsOdkRvwKi|fc_022820e6e342404f0169a2bdb874988191985b8a095d1f143e","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.26 (bc50708) — Say \"stop\" and I'll stop—say \"ship\" and we'll both learn a lesson.\n\nUsage: openclaw agents bind [options]\n\nAdd routing bindings for an agent\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>                  Agent id (defaults to current default agent)\n  --bind <channel[:accountId]>  Binding to add (repeatable). If omitted,\n                                accountId is resolved by channel defaults/hooks.\n                                (default: [])\n  -h, --help                    Display help for command\n  --json                        Output JSON summary (default: false)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":2615,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.26 (bc50708) — Say \"stop\" and I'll stop—say \"ship\" and we'll both learn a lesson.\n\nUsage: openclaw agents bind [options]\n\nAdd routing bindings for an agent\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>                  Agent id (defaults to current default agent)\n  --bind <channel[:accountId]>  Binding to add (repeatable). If omitted,\n                                accountId is resolved by channel defaults/hooks.\n                                (default: [])\n  -h, --help                    Display help for command\n  --json                        Output JSON summary (default: false)","cwd":"C:\\Users\\吗喽\\.openclaw\\workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772273083229}}
