  { agentId: \"u_alice\", match: { channel: \"whatsapp\", peer: { kind: \"direct\", id: \"+8613xxxx\" } } },\n    { agentId: \"u_bob\",   match: { channel: \"whatsapp\", peer: { kind: \"direct\", id: \"+8615xxxx\" } } },\n    { agentId: \"main\",    match: { channel: \"whatsapp\" } } // 兜底\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n如果你同意，我下一步就帮你做。  \n你只要发我一份映射表（2行就行）：\n\n- `+86xxxxxxxxx -> agent名`\n- `+81xxxxxxxxx -> agent名`\n\n我就按你机器现有配置直接改好并给你重启命令。","textSignature":"msg_022820e6e342404f0169a2bdc324588191bd9557690bfbb765"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":343,"output":779,"cacheRead":71936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73058,"cost":{"input":0.00060025,"output":0.010905999999999999,"cacheRead":0.012588799999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02409505}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772273083232}}
