个方案是：**根据已出现会话自动生成并绑定**（实战够用）。  \n你可以把它定时跑（比如每5分钟）就接近全自动。\n\n如果你愿意，我下一步可以直接给你加一个 Windows 计划任务，做到“几乎实时自动建隔离 agent”。","textSignature":"msg_022820e6e342404f0169a2bee908c88191a061e1beef6c48b1"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":247,"output":380,"cacheRead":83712,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84339,"cost":{"input":0.00043225,"output":0.00532,"cacheRead":0.014649599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02040185}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772273382978}}
