{"type":"message","id":"144682b4","parentId":"1af3397a","timestamp":"2026-02-28T10:10:29.434Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]不会太浪费，关键看你怎么做自动化：\n\n- **我刚给你的脚本方案**（定时扫描 sessions.json 并改路由）  \n  几乎不耗模型 token，主要是本地脚本/配置操作。\n\n- **真正耗 token 的**是“每条新消息都让 AI 决策怎么分流”这种方案。  \n  我们不会走这个。\n\n所以你要的“全自动隔离”可以做成**低 token 成本**，基本只在正常聊天时耗 token。\n\n要的话我就给你上一个低频计划任务（比如每 5 分钟跑一次），够自动又省。","textSignature":"msg_022820e6e342404f0169a2bf130ff08191979ec5ce6b62dd4f"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":10331,"output":154,"cacheRead":72192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82677,"cost":{"input":0.018079249999999998,"output":0.002156,"cacheRead":0.0126336,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03286885}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772273425187}}
