{"type":"message","id":"61edb4e3","parentId":"4265eff9","timestamp":"2026-02-28T10:20:07.154Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]一般不会了。  \n这次是首次配对（pairing）没审批导致的，审批后同一个联系人就正常了。\n\n但以后仍可能出现少数情况：\n\n- 你把配置改回了 `dmPolicy: pairing` 且对新号码没审批\n- WhatsApp 会话掉线/登出\n- 网关进程被关掉\n\n要尽量避免的话，给你两条最实用：\n\n1. 保持网关常驻运行  \n2. 新联系人来时，先执行一次：`openclaw pairing approve ...`\n\n如果你要，我可以再给你加一个“新配对自动提醒”的小流程，避免漏审批。","textSignature":"msg_022820e6e342404f0169a2c152617881919308cd7cb91619a7"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":6609,"output":156,"cacheRead":91008,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97773,"cost":{"input":0.01156575,"output":0.002184,"cacheRead":0.0159264,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02967615}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772274000389}}
