{"type":"message","id":"111589a3","parentId":"f6bf0e67","timestamp":"2026-02-28T10:39:36.376Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]可以读，但有范围：\n\n- ✅ **代码文件**：可以直接读（.js/.ts/.py/.cls/.trigger 等文本文件）\n- ✅ **文本类文件**：md/txt/json/yaml 等\n- ⚠️ **Excel (.xlsx/.xls)**：我不能像人眼那样直接“打开表格界面”，但可以通过脚本解析读取内容（需要我跑命令处理）\n- ❌ 你机器外、我没权限路径：读不到\n\n你要的话现在就把文件路径给我，我可以马上帮你读并总结。","textSignature":"msg_022820e6e342404f0169a2c5e32df881918788d87bc02a8f66"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":211,"output":134,"cacheRead":104448,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104793,"cost":{"input":0.00036925,"output":0.001876,"cacheRead":0.0182784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02052365}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772275169178}}
