{"type":"message","id":"3241dfcd","parentId":"d788034e","timestamp":"2026-02-28T10:40:09.790Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_022820e6e342404f0169a2c60868608191b1ab1500406ccc69\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABposYJyE37f1RBRjErpX9lV8rd7xYVznNhTzIZtaCs6Gi8gka8Ul09nzGLAze6t6NFD4RZM2kd2x2aI4OpLsivtW64E1n8N3jIx-BRA3umABoB2CtB25fQaFn1zukkVaQ3RyZy1K5eazLyyIZPQORORb1EYgfExiNwG_pFCjbdMy6tdnhSwmlfOr2eqt57Vs35Uc9-yAky1ul0-zweOFvlWmDfdrNCJmavG7V0Z-dfhQ0387mCDj0HbEAlwA57ngTbmHOQZhi4AT-xnUkX6xMwJ4TJEbsiQhcW1UCQ9jLGqsg5v-AqaGNl_ybyAHzTEOgeELD5ILOHeDho9nGBLbpTBWF5XM41a7JSnoWHcm0lVShB8pd0mHC6kD9s3Nzor_XBpeuQZtoGU3H6VOJqmjAdtswwJbiGJMjzdhUxCMTA3Yb3BgAE1CNpwJ3dfk5PSm7xGGM6rwLlWT89wAY3GEuLRfshRj-_HDaoh9DHJLwy39rF622U6n2e4zLoxu0yficEyRno9aWpJ-5l0N00YGMWN1rTgZAZFylCmOdanZfs9grZvxVW2LHFc2Q3N5YmSMuKj1EIUuuCF-4QruEVprFxV372FaEH9K1vvRa67HQudHj17vsxXTWB_z4cVopNFYdIkmJ04Lp2AZ0w-wvmRnyPNg_YwTjS2qiuHB_2yVVP--hQ9vI1ONttILHUtxhOWXrpHLN9oN0B90LFEK5b3ByHvewFTBl1POBD7H-3421flhqCEUFx6ZKzQMKuCqvfJSGc-FZjSUewBWrQztcUBvGzNAthePgdq_HZ5f31DrIzhLZskxI9kYVBLa2bg2J7f7TdXNZFjQ-oZR3NMLZ158L7gOCOwWBYHWFPBRceMXSv2WYDTi7p9Wanj8JRSZC1QG3XTh0EPtyROrJ_Vrh_EWQHlScDbWWezTXZrMTd6PTNx8ZnYrE=\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]有，常见就两条路：\n\n1. **直接用脚本库读取（最稳）**  \n   - Python: `pandas`, `openpyxl`\n   - Node.js: `xlsx` (SheetJS), `exceljs`\n\n2. **做成 skill**  \n   - 可以封装一个“读 Excel → 输出摘要/JSON”的 skill  \n   - 以后你一句话就能让我读指定表格\n\n我建议你先用第 1 种快速跑通，再封装成 skill。  \n如果你要，我可以直接给你在当前环境做一个 `excel-reader` 小 skill（支持指定文件 + sheet + 行列范围）。","textSignature":"msg_022820e6e342404f0169a2c60957f88191a4fb4e4653234c63"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":128,"output":174,"cacheRead":104704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105006,"cost":{"input":0.000224,"output":0.002436,"cacheRead":0.018323199999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.020983199999999997}},"stopReason"