{"type":"message","id":"c4fa70e9","parentId":"a1f7f1d9","timestamp":"2026-02-28T10:41:43.330Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Suggesting install and workflow**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_022820e6e342404f0169a2c661a6c48191be9a77809c58cab9\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABposZi8cVFLJSrPKvVswC4RWCxtNHGcAhVql1cf95fDf4NWYZ3poeMaaGvtSb_hJjoE0VvEdWqHTVI1cnCdiURZX2KeSA6TYCsTNas3XK5eaT-tlVLEJZZLM2TbODo4fuxoHXLIjkb8w14Liosc8RQG4aCA-oudXpdWShH0HUVWtut399iTItk_JIzLZ7tB_NMqAS9rO64VMXY1UDa2_bzGCLUk1GiPjlQd09o-yDjbg868muLMRLmL1AF8G_NNn3sGwSp491N_af2Nhw1J_LTUogfgzG2UyuNfmdKcDykF0xtl_rqNWLFb0hKc5VIYNTJ7PRCGI98dP7qQ1Jex1aaVcHPj9bS7S5BV5GUKQRIelkLocXJ6KFWyqjw1aCyiRj3wBCNIp1REd8B5EKidSXwlt5hGiBOb3dprUYm8uyGQKTIWsLX4KSUgYGLwBolAsh45Tjo3ARXhrFRub9EwzraAkHBLh17vaX_b-LpAcAssqFg2DBis9dDll85rHQOtHfJH9z9lAvO7M17KzJlQOSOKo18X-aNu1SXUEOjlXpwdpCgVpau88p1CWh23VzNGdd06za6Bk8HuobKg1nT-Dvyrd-4kGB-CD4hVcCK81PmM8S2s_hwkBc7Um9UG5o5GNYT0-Y7FntmeAVYxd0qGYlxYEKpW9MvcjrWkZha6u-zp5AoQgQnh6RoXtNGpUk-wiOH_pTcW_jETv6tARVSjHpSOnxMuu7L_v2DabQytBWrTyMuRxwcvcKALRA4ZVGezpiXddhC420IIpZ4CKJOr7UXQw_b3hOEzEmntkhzqZnjn88PyzaD8ixWi3dDRh27K2xoVxF6f8VGsaa3Q2LLO-YbGhE_gk9i8QpfI1lV6p1DB-cNQA0=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Suggesting install and workflow**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]对，直接用开源 skills 通常更快。  \nOpenClaw 官方推荐的就是 **ClawHub**（公开 skills 仓库）。\n\n我给你一个最快方案（尤其针对你要读 Excel）：\n\n### 方案A（先快用起来）\n1. 安装 ClawHub CLI  \n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n2. 搜技能  \n```bash\nclawhub search \"excel\"\nclawhub search \"xlsx\"\nclawhub search \"spreadsheet\"\n```\n3. 安装你看中的 skill  \n```bash\nclawhub install <skill-slug>\n```\n4. 开新会话让 OpenClaw 重新加载 skills\n\n---\n\n### 方案B（找不到满意的 Excel skill）\n直接用成熟库自己封一层最稳（也很快）：\n- Python: `pandas + openpyxl`\n- Node: `xlsx (SheetJS)` / `exceljs`\n\n然后做一个很小的 `excel-reader` skill（1小时内能搞完），比等社区技能更可控。\n\n---\n\n### 我这边帮你判断结果\n你执行完 `clawhub search \"excel\"` 把结果贴给我，  \n我帮你挑 **最靠谱的 1-2 个**（看更新时间、说明完整度、依赖复杂度），然后给你直接落地。","textSignature":"msg_022820e6e342404f0169a2c662100c81919a523abb602c2420"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":286,"output":313,"cacheRead":108544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":109143,"cost":{"input":0.0005005,"output":0.004382,"cacheRead":0.0189952,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0238777}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772275292803}}
